  "name": "ensue-db-ts-client",
  "description": "A high-performance TypeScript SDK for the ensue-db service that integrates Rust-compiled WebAssembly bindings for efficient cryptographic operations. It facilitates verifiable storage proofs and polynomial commitments over the Pallas elliptic curve using a Structured Reference String (SRS) for data integrity verification. The library provides a dual-interface for JSON-RPC over HTTP and WebSockets, enabling real-time contract updates and batch query execution with verifiable proof-of-read capabilities.",
